---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Support Iowa CYP | Partner, Teach, Volunteer
description: Discover how community partners, educators, State Teen Panel members, and volunteers can support Iowa National Guard children and youth.
permalink: /support/index.html
---
{% set photoNeedsList = photoNeeds() %}
<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden" data-reveal>
  {% set heroPhoto = requestPhoto({
    id: "support-hero-summer-camp",
    context: page.url ~ "#hero",
    note: "Support hero background"
  }) %}
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img
      src="{{ heroPhoto.src }}"
      alt="{{ heroPhoto.alt }}"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover origin-center [transform:scaleX(-1)]"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    >
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/70"></div>
  <div class="relative container min-h-[60vh] py-24 flex items-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl text-white space-y-6 drop-shadow-[0_6px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-secondary">Support Iowa CYP</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-white">Help Guard-connected youth feel seen, equipped, and celebrated</h1>
      <p class="text-white/90 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">Iowa CYP runs on teamwork. Schools, community groups, partners, and volunteers all help keep Guard families steady. Pick the lane that fits you and we’ll follow up with next steps.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="hero-cta" href="#community-partners">Start a partnership</a>
        <a class="hero-cta-secondary" href="#volunteers">Volunteer with us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="sticky top-20 z-30 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border-y border-slate-200" aria-label="Section navigation" data-reveal>
  <div class="container flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#community-partners">
      <span>Partner</span>
    </a>
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#leadership">
      <span>Teach &amp; Lead</span>
    </a>
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#momc">
      <span>Celebrate MOMC</span>
    </a>
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#volunteers">
      <span>Volunteer</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="bg-white py-12" data-reveal>
  <div class="container grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
    <article class="support-feature">
      <span class="support-feature__icon">
        <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-angle-double-down leading-none"></i>
      </span>
      <div class="support-feature__body">
        <h2 class="support-feature__title">Partner With Us</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Boost scholarships, sponsor camps, or lend event space so Guard-connected youth have more chances to gather.</p>
        <a class="support-feature__cta" href="#community-partners">Explore partner lanes</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="support-feature">
      <span class="support-feature__icon">
        <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-tools leading-none"></i>
      </span>
      <div class="support-feature__body">
        <h2 class="support-feature__title">Equip Classrooms</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Download lesson kits, book trainings, and connect with Purple Star School tools for your district.</p>
        <a class="support-feature__cta" href="#leadership">See educator tools</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="support-feature">
      <span class="support-feature__icon">
        <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-star leading-none"></i>
      </span>
      <div class="support-feature__body">
        <h2 class="support-feature__title">Celebrate Together</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Host Purple Up moments, share social graphics, and join statewide Month of the Military Child events.</p>
        <a class="support-feature__cta" href="#momc">Plan your celebration</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="support-feature">
      <span class="support-feature__icon">
        <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-compass leading-none"></i>
      </span>
      <div class="support-feature__body">
        <h2 class="support-feature__title">Volunteer Your Time</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Match your gifts with roles that welcome campers, ease logistics, and inspire our teens.</p>
        <a class="support-feature__cta" href="#volunteers">Find your fit</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="community-partners" class="bg-white py-16" data-reveal>
  <div class="container space-y-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-primary/70">Community partners</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Lift more Guard families with your time, space, or sponsorship</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Local businesses, nonprofits, veteran orgs, and universities help us make more room at the table. Partner support stretches scholarships, covers supplies, and opens new doors for military youth.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.communityPartners }}">Start a partnership</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4">
      {% for partner in partners.items %}
        <article class="content-card flex flex-col gap-4 text-center h-full" data-reveal data-interactive="true">
          {% if partner.logo %}
            <img src="{{ partner.logo }}" alt="{{ partner.name }} logo" class="h-16 object-contain mx-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          {% endif %}
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ partner.name }}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">{{ partner.description }}</p>
          </div>
          {% if partner.website %}
            <a class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mt-auto" href="{{ partner.website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit website</a>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set stpQuote = quotes.items | selectattr('id', 'equalto', 'Q007') | list | first %}
<section id="leadership" class="bg-primary/5 py-20" data-reveal>
  <div class="container space-y-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-5">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-primary/70">Lead &amp; Learn</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-tight">Developing the Next Generation</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Grab ready-to-use lesson plans, mentor guides, and deployment resources that make it simple to grow confident Guard-connected youth.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="content-card space-y-6 h-full" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Educators</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">We equip schools and youth programs with quick-start lesson plans, deployment awareness toolkits, and staff sessions focused on military-connected students.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Staff training on the deployment cycle and student transitions</li>
          <li>Classroom resilience activities and Purple Up celebration guides</li>
          <li>Connections to mental health, tutoring, and family readiness resources</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/20 bg-white/70 p-5 space-y-4">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Purple Star School Program</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">We partner with the Iowa Department of Education so districts can earn the new Purple Star designation that honors schools committed to military-connected students.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 bg-white/80 p-4">
              <h5 class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Core requirements</h5>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Assign a dedicated military family liaison.</li>
                <li>Maintain a resource hub for Guard families.</li>
                <li>Host awareness events that build support.</li>
                <li>Provide staff training on transitions.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 bg-white/80 p-4">
              <h5 class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Application timeline</h5>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Oct–Dec 2025: Applications open</li>
                <li>Jan–Feb 2026: Reviews underway</li>
                <li>Mar 2026: Designations announced</li>
                <li>Apr 2026: Recognition ceremonies</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://educate.iowa.gov/pk-12/award-exchange-programs/purple-star-school-program" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore Purple Star details</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/contact/#general-contact">Request a briefing</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card space-y-6 h-full" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">State Teen Panel (STP)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">STP is our teen leadership crew for Guard-connected youth ages 13–17. Members plan events, advise decisions, and represent Iowa at regional symposiums.</p>
        </div>
        {% if stpQuote %}
          <blockquote class="italic text-primary leading-relaxed bg-primary/5 border border-primary/10 rounded-3xl p-5">
            &ldquo;{{ stpQuote.text }}&rdquo;
            <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-primary/70 mt-3 not-italic">{{ stpQuote.role }}</span>
          </blockquote>
        {% endif %}
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Lead service projects and mentor younger campers</li>
          <li>Earn volunteer hours and leadership experience</li>
          <li>Connect with teens who understand military life</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="aspect-video rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/9on-5cZKmnA"
            title="State Teen Panel spotlight"
            class="w-full h-full"
            loading="lazy"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.stpApply }}">Apply today</a>
          {% if site.links.stpVideo %}
            <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{ site.links.stpVideo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch STP overview</a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="momc" class="bg-white py-20" data-reveal>
  <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.1fr)_0.9fr] lg:items-start">
    <article class="content-card space-y-6 h-full">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-primary/70">Month of the Military Child</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Celebrate with us each April</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Military families with youth are invited to join the statewide celebration of Month of the Military Child (MOMC). We purple up, gather together, and highlight Guard kids whose strength keeps Iowa mission-ready.</p>
        {% set momcKitPhoto = requestPhoto({
          id: "momc-kit",
          context: page.url ~ "#momc-kit",
          note: "MOMC kit photo"
        }) %}
        <img src="{{ momcKitPhoto.src }}" alt="{{ momcKitPhoto.alt }}" class="w-full rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 object-cover">
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Celebrate with us</h3>
        <ol class="relative space-y-6 before:absolute before:left-3 before:top-1 before:h-full before:w-px before:bg-primary/20 before:content-['']">
          <li class="relative flex gap-4 pl-12 text-gray-700">
            <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-xs font-semibold">12</span>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">April 12 · Military Family Ball</p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Formal dinner, dancing, and surprises for every age group. Reserve your spot before seats run out.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="relative flex gap-4 pl-12 text-gray-700">
            <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-xs font-semibold">11</span>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">April 11 · Purple Up Friday</p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Wear purple and share a photo with <span class="font-semibold text-primary">#IApurpleup</span> to shout out Guard-connected youth statewide.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="relative flex gap-4 pl-12 text-gray-700">
            <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-xs font-semibold">All</span>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">All April · Share support</p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Update your social media profile picture, host hallway displays, and invite Guard families to speak in your classrooms.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a class="btn" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSefViH-KPAXAZ0oHB4bZWqKwqdtUH1qMW9BskeU0N2pNbn-tw/viewform?usp=share_link&ouid=100941830380849796397" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register for the Military Family Ball</a>
          <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{ site.links.momcRequest }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Request a Classroom Kit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% set momcSecondaryPhoto = requestPhoto({
      id: "support-family-event-dance",
      context: page.url ~ "#momc-ball",
      note: "MOMC celebration photo"
    }) %}
    <aside class="content-card space-y-6 h-full">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-primary/5 p-6 space-y-5">
        <div class="space-y-2 text-center sm:text-left">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-[0.25em]">Spread the word</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Grab share-ready graphics, emails, and scripts to hype Purple Up all month long.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-4">
          <article class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-white/90 p-5 space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Classroom Kit Flyer</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Snapshot of kit contents, delivery timelines, and how to request more supplies.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary" href="/assets/files/momc_overview.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open flyer<span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-white/90 p-5 space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Ways to Participate Flyer</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Classroom, community, and digital ideas for the whole month.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary" href="/assets/files/momc_flyer.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open flyer<span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-white/90 p-5 space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Purple Profile Graphic</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Simple overlay for Teams, Facebook, or Instagram.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary" href="/assets/files/momc_profile_image.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download image<span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/15 bg-white p-5 space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Need ideas fast? Our team can help you plan a Purple Up moment in one quick call.</p>
          <a class="btn-secondary inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto" href="/contact/#general-contact">Schedule a planning call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img src="{{ momcSecondaryPhoto.src }}" alt="{{ momcSecondaryPhoto.alt }}" class="w-full rounded-3xl border border-primary/20 object-cover">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Where do I pick up the Classroom Kit?</p>
          <p>You’ll receive an email or phone call from your local Soldier &amp; Family Readiness Support Specialist. If you don’t hear from them, reach out and we’ll connect you.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Do we have to celebrate on the same day?</p>
          <p>We encourage everyone to purple up together, but we know schedules vary. Choose a date that works for your staff, students, or youth group&mdash;we’re cheering you on.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">How do I explain MOMC?</p>
          <p>Month of the Military Child honors kids who serve in their own way when a loved one wears the uniform. Use the classroom kit talking points or invite us to speak at your assembly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="volunteers" class="container py-16" data-reveal>
  <div class="content-card md:grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(260px,0.85fr)] md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 space-y-6 md:space-y-0">
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-primary/70">Volunteers</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-tight">Step into a role that matches your strengths</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Whether you like organizing supplies or hanging out with campers, there’s a spot for you. Volunteers help with registration, activity stations, travel logistics, and more.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Tell us what you enjoy and when you’re available—we’ll match you with the right role.</p>
      <blockquote class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-primary/5 p-5 text-sm italic text-primary leading-relaxed">
        “I signed up to help at one weekend camp and stayed all season. Watching Guard teens light up when they see familiar faces is the best part.”<span class="mt-3 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/70 not-italic">— Morgan, volunteer crew lead</span>
      </blockquote>
      <div>
        <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.volunteerInterest }}">Get involved</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4 md:justify-self-center">
      {% set volunteerPhoto = requestPhoto({
        tags: ["volunteers"],
        orientation: "landscape",
        context: page.url ~ "#volunteers-photo",
        note: "Support volunteers section"
      }) %}
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[320px] md:max-w-[360px] rounded-3xl border border-primary/20 bg-white/80 p-3">
        <img src="{{ volunteerPhoto.src }}" alt="{{ volunteerPhoto.alt }}" class="w-full rounded-2xl object-cover aspect-[3/4]" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-white/70 p-6 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    Prefer to start with a quick question? Email us at <a class="font-semibold text-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a> or call your local Soldier &amp; Family Readiness Support Specialist—we’ll point you to the right shift.
  </div>
</section>
